  <notes type="string">Transcribe the pauses; the artist says they are the content.</notes>
  <id type="string">INT_2019_0714</id>
  <title type="string">Beyond the long argument with the colour blue</title>
  <description type="string">Ásdís Gómez talks about how to hang a painting upside down on purpose. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as &quot;…&quot;.</description>
